    "\n",
    "| Problem | Decision | Method Used | Reason |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| TotalCharges stored as object (text) | Convert to numeric | `pd.to_numeric(..., errors='coerce')` | ML models require numeric types; 'coerce' converts problematic values to NaN for visibility |\n",
    "| 11 missing values in TotalCharges | Delete rows | `df.dropna(subset=['TotalCharges'])` | These likely represent incomplete records; only 0.16% of data, safe to remove |\n",
    "| Negative tenure values (-1) | Delete rows | `df[df['tenure'] >= 0]` | Negative tenure is impossible; indicates data errors; only 3 rows affected |\n",
