    "| SeniorCitizen stored as 0/1 | Keep as-is, document | No change | Binary encoding is valid for modeling; 0/1 is more compact than 'Yes'/'No' |\n",
    "| Whitespace in categorical columns | Strip whitespace | `df[col].str.strip()` for object types | Inconsistent spacing can create artificial categories (e.g., 'Yes' vs 'Yes ') |"
